<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NatWest lowers airlines.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NatWest lowers airlines.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest said it lowered its ratings on Delta Air Lines Inc, AMR Corp and UAL Corp to hold from buy and lowered the recommendation on Southwest Airlines Co to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- In morning trade, Delta fell 1-1/8 to 93-1/4, AMR eased 3/8 to 96, UAL was unchanged at 73-1/4 and Southwest slipped 1/8 to 26-7/8.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
